{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和服也很适合爱理啊……」", "text_idx": 127, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，新吾同学这么说呢～」", "text_idx": 129, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0607", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就这么想让我亲口说吗，真拿你没办法」", "text_idx": 132, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我害羞地摸着脸。", "text_idx": 133, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是……爱理穿和服的样子，真是漂亮到让我都大吃一惊。", "text_idx": 134, "plain": "但是……爱理穿和服的样子，真是漂亮到让我都大吃一惊。", "plain_idx": 134, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说想看的是新吾吧。真是的，我都那么费尽心思准备了……」", "text_idx": 135, "plain": "「说想看的是新吾吧。真是的，我都那么费尽心思准备了……」", "plain_idx": 135, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar3719", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，必须多夸夸爱理才行啊～」", "text_idx": 138, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0307", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原来如此」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0654", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
