{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是爱理同学确实很开心的呢　啊啊，真是可喜可贺……」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": "「但是爱理同学确实很开心的呢　啊啊，真是可喜可贺……」", "plain_idx": 151, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0608", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_17.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯，和服真是有新年的风味啊。小熊喵也来，再次谨贺新年～」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": "「嗯嗯，和服真是有新年的风味啊。小熊喵也来，再次谨贺新年～」", "plain_idx": 153, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0308", "char_id": "みう"}]}
